  datTabla: "<thead><tr><th>Willakuy</th><th>Imata tupun</th><th>Píxelpa sayaynin</th><th>Muyuy imapaq apaykachan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>NASA Power</td><td>Para, q'oñiy, inti k'anchay, wayra, hump'iypas, sapa p'unchaw 1981-manta</td><td>0,5° × 0,625° (~55 km)</td><td>Motor: 45 tarpuy p'unchaw p'unchaw, chakraykipa altunman allichasqa</td></tr><tr><td>GPM Imerg</td><td>Hanaq pachamanta sapa kuskan horapi tupusqa para</td><td>0,1° (~11 km)</td><td>«Kunan chakrayki imayna»: qhipa p'unchawkunapa paran</td></tr><tr><td>SMAP L4</td><td>Allpa hawapi sapi kaq suyupipas allpapa hump'iynin</td><td>9 km</td><td>Kunan tarpunapaq hump'iy kanchu</td></tr><tr><td>Modis NDVI (Terra)</td><td>Yurakunapa q'omer kaynin (yura yupay)</td><td>250 m</td><td>Chakraykipa q'omer kaynin huk watakunawan tupachisqa</td></tr><tr><td>Modis LST (Terra)</td><td>P'unchaw allpa hawapa q'oñiynin</td><td>1 km</td><td>Chakra hawapi q'oñi (Ecostresspa rantinpi)</td></tr><tr><td>HLS (Landsat 8/9, Sentinel-2)</td><td>Chakrapa fotonta</td><td>30 m</td><td>Chakraykita satélitemanta qhaway</td></tr><tr><td>Grace, Grace-FO</td><td>Regionpi waqaychasqa tukuy yaku (allpa, ukhu yaku, rit'i)</td><td>~300 km</td><td>Cuencapa waqaychasqa yakun watakunawan pisiyanchu</td></tr><tr><td>GEDI</td><td>Yurakunapa kawsaq kaykunan sayayninpas, láserwan</td><td>1 km</td><td>Muyuriqpi hayk'a yurakuna kan</td></tr><tr><td>SRTM / Nasadem, Copernicus DEM</td><td>Allpapa altun</td><td>30-manta 90 m-kama</td><td>Altun, wichay, allpa apakuypas</td></tr><tr><td>NEX-GDDP-CMIP6</td><td>2050-paq yuyaykusqa pacha (5 modelo)</td><td>0,25°</td><td>4-ñiqi pasopi «2050» botonkuna</td></tr><tr><td>Ecostress</td><td>Yurakunapa q'oñiynin yaku sasachakuyninpas</td><td>70 m</td><td>Mana apaykachasqa: Earthdata cuentata mañakun, manataq kichasqa capayuqchu (Modis LST apaykachakun)</td></tr></tbody>",
  datSvtT: "📡 Satélite utaq allpapi tupuy",
  datSvt: "<p>Satéliteqa hanaqmanta hatun k'uchuta tupun (30 m-manta 300 km-kama), yaqa sapa kuti mana chiqanta: allpa hawapa llimpinta utaq q'oñiyninta. Huk estación utaq pluviómetroqa huk chiqanllapi tupun, chiqanta allintapas, ichaqa chayllapi.</p><p>Kuska aswan allin: satéliteqa estación mana kasqan chiqankunata hunt'an, estacióntaq satéliteta allichan. Muyuyqa NASA Powerta chakraykipa altunwan allichan (sapa 1000 m −6,5 °C), sapa regionpaq para yupaywanpas; qam yuyasqayki qasakunawan chiri tutakunata allichan; paratataq ERA5-wan tupachin. Senamhipa estacionninkunawan (Pisco) allichanaraqmi.</p>",
  datArmT: "🧩 Hukniray sayayniyuq willakuykuna imaynatataq huñukunku",
  datArm: "<p>Sapa willakuyqa kikin píxel sayayniyuq, kikin kutiyniyuqmi: NASA Power ~55 km sapa p'unchaw, Imerg 11 km sapa kuskan hora, SMAP 9 km, Modis 250 m-manta 1 km-kama, HLS 30 m, Grace ~300 km sapa killa, GEDI 1 km.</p><p>Muyuyqa huk kikin cuadrículaman, huk kikin calendarioman apan: NASA Powerpa 398 k'uchun tukuy Perúta qatan; sapa k'uchupa pachan chakrapa cheqaq altunman uraykachikun; satélitekunataq chakrapa chiqanpi ñawinchakun; tukuytaq sapa killapi sapa tarpuypi (agostomanta julio killakama) huñukun, chakra runa yuyasqan hina. Chhaynapim muyuykunaqa tukuy chiqankunapi kikin kamachiykunawan tupachikun.</p>",
